# Docs and ops

- Write runbooks step-by-step; use symptom → fix tables for troubleshooting.
- Hub is `docs/README.md`; link instead of duplicating long procedures.
- Document **existing** tooling only (`compose.yaml`, `start.bat`, `pnpm migration:*`, `scripts/db-snapshot.ps1`, `scripts/db-restore.ps1`). Do not invent tunnel/ngrok scripts.
- Live DB is PostgreSQL (volume / `DATABASE_URL`) — not in git. Shared state: `data/app.snapshot.sql` (PW-style snapshot/restore).
- Production secrets: `.env.production.example` template; never commit real `.env.production`.
- Human-facing LoomCRM ops/onboarding docs: Ukrainian. Keep claims aligned with `compose.yaml` and health endpoints (`/api/v1/health/live`, `/ready`).
